[node name="Label2" type="Label" parent="Control/HBoxContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=13146904]
layout_mode = 2
text = "An offensive alien with the goal of imprisoning all lawbreakers, criminals, and aliens that beat it in Alien Soccer. Warden fires out chain bullets that restrict the enemy's abilities and field!

Default - Incarceration
Cooldown: 200
Duration: 90
Launches a chain forwards that goes through the ball. Hitting the enemy pauses their ability cooldowns, preventing both the default and ultimate abilities from recharging.

Ultimate - Judgement
Charge: 650
Duration: 200
Fires a vertical chain forwards that plants itself at the middle section of the opponent's field. The ball can pass through this chain, but if the opponent makes contact, their abilities are fully locked and cannot be used. The opponent cannot pass through the chain.

"
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_pas4f")
autowrap_mode = 2
